THM3865_TARGET Delta0+lambda*L^5;every non-tangent linear L
THM3865_CONTROLS L=C and L=A+C
THM3865_NORMALIZATION L=-D_L(t)/lambda,M=t*L;four origins;one infinity
THM3865_UFD_CHART (S_L)_L=k[t,y,(y^2-D_L(t))^-1]
THM3865_SPECIAL_FIBRE (W-mu*M^2)(W+mu*M^2),mu^2=kappa
THM3865_NAGATA Cl(S_L)=Z^2/<(1,1)>=Z;units=k*
THM3865_THREE_TORSION NONE
THM3865_GLOBAL_CUBIC normal finite-flat S3 algebra with this discriminant=NONE
THM3865_SCOPE non-tangent fifth-degree family; other one-place discriminants and JC2 open
SEMANTIC_SHA256 7c662f08ea830a5690d2b47f1e8057279521611080700778941e27b07d6e5648
CHECKS 30
